              "value": "(primal, transmutation)\n\nTrigger: The charau-ka's turn begins.\n\nFrequency: 1/hour\n\nThe charau-ka is quickened until the end of its turn, and can use the extra action to Stride or Strike. Due to its loud wailing while in a shrieking frenzy, the charau-ka can't speak and automatically critically fails all Stealth checks."
